  "asset": {
    "id": "market-parasol",
    "category": "objects",
    "title": {
      "en": "Market Parasol",
      "de": "Marktschirm"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "A tilting market parasol with a concrete base, an aluminium mast, an eight-rib canopy (11 degrees plan offset so all eight ribs show in elevation), fabric scallops and a sliding runner whose stretchers fold the ribs down along the mast.",
      "de": "Ein neigbarer Marktschirm mit Betonfuß, Aluminiummast, achtspeichigem Schirm (11 Grad Planversatz, damit alle acht Speichen im Aufriss sichtbar sind), Stoffbögen und einem Läufer, dessen Spreizen die Speichen am Mast nach unten klappen."
    },
    "tags": [
      "parasol",
      "market",
      "tilt",
      "canopy",
      "wind",
      "street-furniture"
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "author": "Semio staffage content (objects worker)",
      "method": "handcrafted",
      "created": "2026-10-29",
      "references": [
        {
          "id": "en-1991-1-4",
          "citation": "EN 1991-1-4:2005 Eurocode 1: Actions on structures, Part 1-4: General actions, wind actions."
        },
        {
          "id": "en-1992-1-1",
          "citation": "EN 1992-1-1:2004 Eurocode 2: Design of concrete structures, Part 1-1: General rules (E_cm for C30/37)."
        },
        {
          "id": "en-1999-1-1",
          "citation": "EN 1999-1-1:2007 Eurocode 9: Design of aluminium structures, Part 1-1: General structural rules (E = 70 GPa)."
        },
        {
          "id": "ashby-2011",
          "citation": "Ashby, M. F. (2011). Materials Selection in Mechanical Design, 4th ed., Butterworth-Heinemann."
        },
        {
          "id": "incropera-2018",
          "citation": "Incropera, F. P., DeWitt, D. P., Bergman, T. L., Lavine, A. S. (2018). Fundamentals of Heat and Mass Transfer, 8th ed., Wiley."
        }
      ],
      "notes": {
        "en": "Side elevation. The base is a 0.4 x 0.3 x 0.2 m concrete block (about 58 kg); the foot is modelled as a fixed socket, so tipping and sliding of the base are not checked (ballast data unknown). Wind: q = 0.5 rho v^2 at v = 8 m/s (about 40 Pa), drag 1.2 and uplift 0.5 on 5.3 m2 projected canopy, authored estimates on the basis of EN 1991-1-4. Canopy ribs are 2 of 8 ribs; ribs and panels carry their masses for four ribs each side. Tilt is 8 degrees towards the sun on the right.",
        "de": "Seitenansicht. Der Fuß ist ein Betonblock 0,4 x 0,3 x 0,2 m (etwa 58 kg); der Fuß ist als feste Hülse modelliert, Kippen und Gleiten des Fußes werden nicht nachgewiesen (Ballastdaten unbekannt). Wind: q = 0,5 rho v^2 bei v = 8 m/s (etwa 40 Pa), Widerstand 1,2 und Auftrieb 0,5 auf 5,3 m² projizierter Schirmfläche, Schätzungen auf Basis EN 1991-1-4. Die Rippen sind 2 von 8; Rippen und Bahnen tragen die Masse für je vier Rippen pro Seite. Neigung 8 Grad zur Sonne rechts."
      }
    },
